"<p>If you prefer full control over your environment, want to run Nitrobase behind an existing reverse proxy, or are developing locally, you can install Nitrobase manually using Git and Docker Compose.</p>\n<h2>Prerequisites</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Docker 24.0+ and Docker Compose v2.24+ installed on the host.</li>\n<li>OpenSSL CLI tool installed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Installation Steps</h2>\n<h3>1. Clone the Repository</h3>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/nitrobase/nitrobase.git</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nitrobase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nitrobase</span></span></code></pre>\n<h3>2. Configure Environment Variables</h3>\n<p>Copy the template configuration file:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cp</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env.example</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>Generate cryptographically secure 32-byte hex keys:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"s|^ENCRYPTION_KEY=.*|ENCRYPTION_KEY=$(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openssl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rand </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-hex</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)|\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"s|^SESSION_SECRET=.*|SESSION_SECRET=$(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openssl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rand </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-hex</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)|\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"s|^POSTGRES_PASSWORD=.*|POSTGRES_PASSWORD=$(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openssl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rand </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-hex</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)|\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"NITROBASE_IMAGE=nitrobase\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"NITROBASE_VERSION=local\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chmod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 600</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"docCallout docCallout-caution\"><div class=\"docCalloutHeader\"><span class=\"docCalloutBadge\">CAUTION</span><span class=\"docCalloutTitle\">Backup Your Encryption Key</span></div><div class=\"docCalloutContent\">\n<p>Store your <code>ENCRYPTION_KEY</code> in a password manager outside of the server! If this key is lost, all stored credentials, SSH keys, and encrypted backups cannot be decrypted.</p>\n</div></div>\n<h3>3. Start the Stack</h3>\n<p>For building from the local checkout:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker-compose.prod.yml</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker-compose.build.yml</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --build</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>Or to use pre-built official release images:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker-compose.prod.yml</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Core Environment Variables Reference</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Variable</th><th align=\"left\">Required</th><th align=\"left\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>DATABASE_URL</code></td><td align=\"left\"><strong>Yes</strong></td><td align=\"left\">Postgres connection string (e.g., <code>postgresql://nitrobase:pass@postgres:5432/nitrobase</code>).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>ENCRYPTION_KEY</code></td><td align=\"left\"><strong>Yes</strong></td><td align=\"left\">32+ character random key for encrypting secrets at rest with HKDF.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>SESSION_SECRET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><strong>Yes</strong></td><td align=\"left\">32+ character random key for sealing session cookies.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>APP_URL</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">Public URL of the panel. When starting with <code>https://</code>, session cookies receive the <code>Secure</code> flag.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>TRUST_PROXY</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">Set to <code>true</code> when running behind Traefik or Cloudflare to read real client IP.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>ACME_EMAIL</code></td><td align=\"left\">No</td><td align=\"left\">Email address used for Let's Encrypt certificate renewal notifications.</td></tr></tbody></table>"